                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Medicine of the voice ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "song circle",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You're invited to a medicine of the voice song circle. We will be joining our hearts, prayers, and voices to nourish our aliveness through sound. I will be sharing "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "hymns and medicine songs from around the world to co-create a healing field for our minds, bodies, and world.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The songs shared are dedicated "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "to supporting you in strengthening your connection to love and your ability to heal, uplift, and empower yourself through sound",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ". Whether you're an experienced vocalist or a first-time singer, this circle is a welcoming sanctuary where your voice is celebrated and cherished."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "📅 Date: April 18th",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "🕒 Time: 3pm PST, 12pm HI, 6pm EST",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "📍 Location: Zoom",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I hope you can join us. It will be a heartwarming, love-filled, and joyous time being together in connection with our voices, hearts, and prayers!"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
